      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm also interested in the more 'hidden' or less formal side of the trade routes. besides the big official merchants and scholars, were there other types of groups or even specific types of people/entities that played a role in the movement of smaller, perhaps less official, goods or information along these paths?",
